    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the following Order issued by Honourable Minister of Finance and Mass Media, by virtue of thepower vested in him by Section 25, read with Section 32 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) as amended, and published inthe Extraordinary Gazette No. 2065/57 of 06.04.2018 to do by this Order amend the Existing Notification No. 1004, publishedin the Extraordinary Gazette No. 2049/4 dated December 11, 2017 in order to revise existing the license fee for bottlingToddy, specified in the Item No. 03 of Schedule I of that Notification by substituting the license fee, with effect from April 01,2018 was passed by Parliament on June 21, 2018.",
